    "created_at": "2019-08-12T20:51:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-08-12T20:51:42Z",
    "body": "The captcha is indeed missing now (so registration isn't possible). The site also lacks HTTPS support.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, IANA is now (since 2017) using a GitHub [link-relations/registry](https://github.com/link-relations/registry#link-relation-registry-interface) repository for managing it's [Link Relations](https://www.iana.org/assignments/link-relations/link-relations.xhtml) registry.\r\n\r\nThat repository is covered by the IETF's [contribution terms](https://github.com/link-relations/registry#link-relation-registry-interface) as well as code of conduct.\r\n\r\nPerhaps there is a way to combine efforts?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
