    "updated_at": "2019-08-20T01:47:42Z",
    "body": "Happy to try to combine efforts again. As @BigBlueHat says, we're using a GitHub issues list to manage that registry now, so it should be lower friction. \r\n\r\nWe're also looking at refining that (input welcome) to make it easier, and putting more Web-related registries there (probably under a dedicated org). Next up should be well-known URIs, then HTTP headers.",
